Z||000000||KnightRyder31||09-12-2000||10:55 AM||||Actually, I have two problems and questions. One, when I start my car, it revs to about 2K RPMS... and the car feels like its trying to kick down the RPMS...and then it starts to shake, and vibrate. WTF???<BR>Two, Whenever I drive my car for a while, it starts to smoke out of the rear gril(the one right behind the rear window)??? It smells funky...not like oil. I can't desribe it...maybe burning raidiator fluid? I really need some help! This better not be a cracked block...I'll be F'd if it is!||||reg||13
