Z||000005||myblack86GT||09-12-2000||05:50 PM||||Check that pipe that goes from the EGR Valve to under the intake. If it has a crack in it, thats the reason for the car reving to 2K. I had that problem. You can replace it with a flexable hose, that way it wont crack again. Sorry I have to be so vauge, but thats all I know about it||||reg||1
