Z||000010||StuGood||09-13-2000||01:05 PM||||"Smoke from under hood," and "ticks while runs" sounds like exhaust leak to me.  For example - exhaust manifold crack, etc.<P>Fast idle sounds like intake manifold leak - EGR tube is first place I'd look.   ||||reg||9
